  "details": "The buttons on QM > VRC+ wrongly open Inventory > Stickers at the first operation of each app launch.\n\nRepro steps:\n\n1. Launch the VRChat app\n\n2. Open QM. Press QM > VRC+ > Prints button\n\n3. It will open the Inventory > Stickers. It should be Inventory > Prints\n\n4. Close the menu\n\n5. Open QM. Press the Prints button again\n\n6. It will open Inventory > Prints correctly\n\nThe same behavior happens with other buttons, such as User Icons, Photos, and Emojis.",
